msgid ""
"A plugin value *is* one build's session. The host creates a fresh session "
"per selected plugin per build, from the prototype. It drops the session "
"when the build ends, whether it succeeded or failed. ``Drop`` replaces an "
"unload callback: we close files or connections there."
msgstr ""

#: ../../plugins.rst:255
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "Use ``read_plugin_config`` and ``read_plugin_file`` during load. They "
#| "fingerprint the bytes actually read and declare dependencies. Keep "
#| "loaded state unchanged throughout the build. If you read other files "
#| "yourself, declare their paths in ``session.dependencies`` and append a "
#| "fingerprint of the loaded values to ``session.cache_key``. Append "
#| "selected environment values there too. Do not erase the fingerprints "
